  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "GitLab CI+packaging: Remove Ninja support from our Debian packaging",
  "description": "Newer versions of Debian and Ubuntu enable LTO by default. This means we\nlink with gcc's lto-wrapper, which creates a Makefile and runs\n`getenv(\"MAKE\")` on it. Setting MAKE=ninja will fail, so don't do that.\nRemove cmake+ninja support from our Debian packaging since it's now\nproblematic.",
  "state": "merged",
