        {
          "id": 3406887406,
          "type": null,
          "body": "The full error is\n\n```\nCMake Error at /usr/share/cmake-4.2/Modules/CMakeTestCCompiler.cmake:67 (message):\n  The C compiler\n\n    \"/usr/lib/ccache/gcc\"\n\n  is not able to compile a simple test program.\n\n  It fails with the following output:\n\n    Change Dir: '/wireshark/obj-x86_64-linux-gnu/CMakeFiles/CMakeScratch/TryCompile-NQwGua'\n    \n    Run Build Command(s): /usr/bin/ninja -v cmTC_01b05\n    [1/2] /usr/lib/ccache/gcc   -g -O2 -Werror=implicit-function-declaration -fno-omit-frame-pointer -mno-omit-leaf-frame-pointer -ffile-prefix-map=/wireshark=. -flto=auto -ffat-lto-objects -fstack-protector-strong -fstack-clash-protection -Wformat -Werror=format-security -fcf-protection -fdebug-prefix-map=/wireshark=/usr/src/wireshark-4.7.0 -Wdate-time -D_FORTIFY_SOURCE=3 -o CMakeFiles/cmTC_01b05.dir/testCCompiler.c.o -c /wireshark/obj-x86_64-linux-gnu/CMakeFiles/CMakeScratch/TryCompile-NQwGua/testCCompiler.c\n    [2/2] : && /usr/lib/ccache/gcc -g -O2 -Werror=implicit-function-declaration -fno-omit-frame-pointer -mno-omit-leaf-frame-pointer -ffile-prefix-map=/wireshark=. -flto=auto -ffat-lto-objects -fstack-protector-strong -fstack-clash-protection -Wformat -Werror=format-security -fcf-protection -fdebug-prefix-map=/wireshark=/usr/src/wireshark-4.7.0 -Wdate-time -D_FORTIFY_SOURCE=3 -Wl,-Bsymbolic-functions -Wl,--package-metadata=%7B%22type%22:%22deb%22%2C%22os%22:%22ubuntu%22%2C%22name%22:%22wireshark%22%2C%22version%22:%224.7.0%22%2C%22architecture%22:%22amd64%22%7D -flto=auto -ffat-lto-objects -Wl,-z,relro CMakeFiles/cmTC_01b05.dir/testCCompiler.c.o -o cmTC_01b05   && :\n    FAILED: [code=1] cmTC_01b05 \n    : && /usr/lib/ccache/gcc -g -O2 -Werror=implicit-function-declaration -fno-omit-frame-pointer -mno-omit-leaf-frame-pointer -ffile-prefix-map=/wireshark=. -flto=auto -ffat-lto-objects -fstack-protector-strong -fstack-clash-protection -Wformat -Werror=format-security -fcf-protection -fdebug-prefix-map=/wireshark=/usr/src/wireshark-4.7.0 -Wdate-time -D_FORTIFY_SOURCE=3 -Wl,-Bsymbolic-functions -Wl,--package-metadata=%7B%22type%22:%22deb%22%2C%22os%22:%22ubuntu%22%2C%22name%22:%22wireshark%22%2C%22version%22:%224.7.0%22%2C%22architecture%22:%22amd64%22%7D -flto=auto -ffat-lto-objects -Wl,-z,relro CMakeFiles/cmTC_01b05.dir/testCCompiler.c.o -o cmTC_01b05   && :\n    ninja: error: /tmp/ccRxEbAc.mk:1: lexing error\n    \n    lto-wrapper: fatal error: ninja returned 1 exit status\n    compilation terminated.\n    /usr/bin/x86_64-linux-gnu-ld.bfd: error: lto-wrapper failed\n    collect2: error: ld returned 1 exit status\n    ninja: build stopped: subcommand failed.\n```\n\nIf I copy the test C code from */usr/share/cmake-4.2/Modules/CMakeTestCCompiler.cmake* to */tmp/test.c* and run\n\n```\n/usr/lib/ccache/gcc -g -O2 -Werror=implicit-function-declaration -fno-omit-frame-pointer -mno-omit-leaf-frame-pointer -ffile-prefix-map=/wireshark=. -flto=auto -ffat-lto-objects -fstack-protector-strong -fstack-clash-protection -Wformat -Werror=format-security -fcf-protection -fdebug-prefix-map=/wireshark=/usr/src/wireshark-4.7.0 -Wdate-time -D_FORTIFY_SOURCE=3 -o /tmp/test.o -c /tmp/test.c\n/usr/lib/ccache/gcc -g -O2 -Werror=implicit-function-declaration -fno-omit-frame-pointer -mno-omit-leaf-frame-pointer -ffile-prefix-map=/wireshark=. -flto=auto -ffat-lto-objects -fstack-protector-strong -fstack-clash-protection -Wformat -Werror=format-security -fcf-protection -fdebug-prefix-map=/wireshark=/usr/src/wireshark-4.7.0 -Wdate-time -D_FORTIFY_SOURCE=3 -Wl,-Bsymbolic-functions -Wl,--package-metadata=%7B%22type%22:%22deb%22%2C%22os%22:%22ubuntu%22%2C%22name%22:%22wireshark%22%2C%22version%22:%224.7.0%22%2C%22architecture%22:%22amd64%22%7D -flto=auto -ffat-lto-objects -Wl,-z,relro /tmp/test.o -o /tmp/test\n```\n\nit works fine. It also works fine with plain /usr/bin/gcc.",
