      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 3407463619,
          "type": null,
          "body": "OK, the relevant line from the error output is\n\n    ninja: error: /tmp/ccpFxVoz.mk:1: lexing error\n\nWe were passing `MAKE=ninja` to dpkg-buildpackage, and [gcc's lto-wrapper](https://github.com/gcc-mirror/gcc/blob/master/gcc/lto-wrapper.cc#L2188) expects make to be \"make\", likely even GNU make.",
